    rows: [["Capacity at design condition", "Matched-system extended data", "Must meet the calculated load"], ["Installed configuration", `${left} and ${right} options that fit the building`, "Include distribution, electrical, drainage, and controls"], ["Ownership support", "Written warranty, parts path, manuals, and qualified service", "Judge the exact regional product, not brand reputation"]],
