    questions: [[`Is ${left} better than ${right}?`, `Not as a brand-wide statement. Compare exact models that meet the same load and application, then weigh controls, support, warranty, installation, and price.`], ["Can I compare the highest efficiency numbers?", "Only when they describe the same equipment class, capacity range, matched configuration, and test metric; series maxima usually do not."], ["Which option is cheaper to own?", "Installed cost, tariffs, climate, load, maintenance, repair access, parts, and service life all matter, so a product price alone cannot answer ownership cost."]],
